      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.19,
      "end_seconds": 272.08,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? It's hard to say. Osteoarthritis of the right hip is one possibility and bursitis another, and I'd rather not commit yet"
