      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.25,
      "end_seconds": 287.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned but right now osteoarthritis of the right hip is my leading thought not anything worse"
