      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.65,
      "end_seconds": 317.54,
      "duration_seconds": 21.89,
      "text": "we should do blood tests for joint pain. I'd rather check than guess and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm gonna order a hip X-ray for hip pain. I'd like you to take paracetamol 1 gram up to four times a day long term. That should help with hip pain"
    },
