      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.36,
      "end_seconds": 351.73,
      "duration_seconds": 25.37,
      "text": "keep walking in short regular bursts and use a stick in the opposite hand i'm gonna send a referral to physiotherapy the orthopaedic clinic would be the right next step I'll refer you the thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse if that happens go to emergency let's plan a check in six weeks have I covered everything you wanted?"
